lds,","start":6.8},{"w":"or","start":7.28},{"w":"CRFs.","start":7.972}]},{"id":"c02","start":9.063,"end":17.097,"marks":{},"text":"Last time, hidden Markov models tagged words using just two kinds of chances. Today's model can use as many clues as you like.","words":[{"w":"Last","start":9.063},{"w":"time,","start":9.463},{"w":"hidden","start":9.783},{"w":"Markov","start":10.243},{"w":"models","start":10.703},{"w":"tagged","start":11.223},{"w":"words","start":11.623},{"w":"using","start":12.103},{"w":"just","start":12.503},{"w":"two","start":12.743},{"w":"kinds","start":12.983},{"w":"of","start":13.263},{"w":"chances.","start":13.423},{"w":"Today's","start":14.163},{"w":"model","start":14.903},{"w":"can","start":15.263},{"w":"use","start":15.463},{"w":"as","start":15.663},{"w":"many","start":15.823},{"w":"clues","start":16.103},{"w":"as","start":16.463},{"w":"you","start":16.583},{"w":"like.","start":16.823}]}],"title":"Welcome","shortTitle":"Welcome","props":{"kicker":"Unit 2 · Lesson 6","title":"Conditional Random Fields","subtitle":"Tagging with many clues at once"},"start":0.6,"end":17.097,"startFrame":0,"durationInFrames":540},{"id":"idea","kind":"core","component":"BigIdea","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c03","start":18,"end":24.89,"marks":{},"text":"Here's the idea. A CRF tags the whole sentence at once, and it can use as many clues as you like to do it.","words":[{"w":"Here's","start":18},{"w":"the","start":18.36},{"w":"idea.","start":18.56},{"w":"A","start":19.28},{"w":"CRF","start":19.8},{"w":"tags","start":20.32},{"w":"the","start":20.8},{"w":"whole","start":20.92},{"w":"sentence","start":21.16},{"w":"at","start":21.64},{"w":"once,","start":21.84},{"w":"and","start":22.2},{"w":"it","start":22.4},{"w":"can","start":22.56},{"w":"use","start":22.76},{"w":"as","start":23},{"w":"many","start":23.16},{"w":"clues","start":23.4},{"w":"as","start":23.8},{"w":"you","start":23.96},{"w":"like","start":24.12},{"w":"to","start":24.36},{"w":"do","start":24.52},{"w":"it.","start":24.72}]}],"title":"The big idea","shortTitle":"The big idea","props":{"kicker":"Key idea","text":"A CRF tags the whole sentence at once, using as many clues as you like.","highlight":["whole sentence","many clues"]},"start":18,"end":24.89,"startFrame":540,"durationInFrames":234},{"id":"crf","kind":"core","component":"Definition","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c04","start":25.8,"end":34.933,"marks":{},"text":"CRF stands for conditional random field. It's a discriminative model that scores a whole sequence of tags at once, using any clues you give it.","words":[{"w":"CRF","start":26.28},{"w":"stands","start":26.76},{"w":"for","start":27.24},{"w":"conditional","start":27.48},{"w":"random","start":27.987},{"w":"field.","start":28.493},{"w":"It's","start":29},{"w":"a","start":29.36},{"w":"discriminative","start":29.48},{"w":"model","start":30.36},{"w":"that","start":30.72},{"w":"scores","start":30.92},{"w":"a","start":31.32},{"w":"whole","start":31.44},{"w":"sequence","start":31.72},{"w":"of","start":32.2},{"w":"tags","start":32.36},{"w":"at","start":32.8},{"w":"once,","start":33},{"w":"using","start":33.44},{"w":"any","start":33.8},{"w":"clues","start":34.04},{"w":"you","start":34.4},{"w":"give","start":34.6},{"w":"it.","start":34.76}]},{"id":"c05","start":35.333,"end":43.431,"marks":{},"text":"For example, the word Paris starts with a capital letter and comes right after \"to\". Together, those clues point strongly to a place name.","words":[{"w":"For","start":35.333},{"w":"example,","start":35.493},{"w":"the","start":36.053},{"w":"word","start":36.213},{"w":"Paris","start":36.493},{"w":"starts","start":36.893},{"w":"with","start":37.253},{"w":"a","start":37.373},{"w":"capital","start":37.453},{"w":"letter","start":37.933},{"w":"and","start":38.253},{"w":"comes","start":38.453},{"w":"right","start":38.853},{"w":"after","start":39.133},{"w":"\"to\".","start":39.633},{"w":"Together,","start":40.133},{"w":"those","start":40.933},{"w":"clues","start":41.333},{"w":"point","start":41.813},{"w":"strongly","start":42.093},{"w":"to","start":42.533},{"w":"a","start":42.693},{"w":"place","start":42.853},{"w":"name.","start":43.133}]},{"id":"c06","start":43.831,"end":49.625,"marks":{},"text":"Think of a detective who weighs every clue at once, rather than only looking at the last step they took.","words":[{"w":"Think","start":43.831},{"w":"of","start":44.031},{"w":"a","start":44.151},{"w":"detective","start":44.271},{"w":"who","start":44.871},{"w":"weighs","start":45.111},{"w":"every","start":45.511},{"w":"clue","start":45.831},{"w":"at","start":46.191},{"w":"once,","start":46.351},{"w":"rather","start":46.871},{"w":"than","start":47.271},{"w":"only","start":47.511},{"w":"looking","start":47.791},{"w":"at","start":48.111},{"w":"the","start":48.271},{"w":"last","start":48.391},{"w":"step","start":48.711},{"w":"they","start":49.071},{"w":"took.","start":49.271}]}],"title":"What is a CRF?","shortTitle":"What is a CRF?","props":{"kicker":"Definition","term":"CRF","definition":"Conditional random field: a discriminative model that scores a whole sequence of tags, using any clues you give it.","example":"Paris: capital letter + after “to” → place","analogy":"A detective who weighs every clue at once, not just the last step."},"start":25.8,"end":49.625,"startFrame":774,"durationInFrames":742},{"id":"clues","kind":"core","component":"Bullets","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c07","start":50.533,"end":54.807,"marks":{},"text":"What sort of clues? Almost anything you can check about the words. For example:","words":[{"w":"What","start":50.533},{"w":"sort","start":50.733},{"w":"of","start":50.973},{"w":"clues?","start":51.133},{"w":"Almost","start":51.693},{"w":"anything","start":52.053},{"w":"you","start":52.453},{"w":"can","start":52.613},{"w":"check","start":52.773},{"w":"about","start":53.053},{"w":"the","start":53.253},{"w":"words.","start":53.413},{"w":"For","start":53.893},{"w":"example:","start":54.133}]},{"id":"c08","start":55.207,"end":57.256,"marks":{},"text":"Does the word start with a capital letter?","words":[{"w":"Does","start":55.207},{"w":"the","start":55.407},{"w":"word","start":55.567},{"w":"start","start":55.807},{"w":"with","start":56.167},{"w":"a","start":56.287},{"w":"capital","start":56.407},{"w":"letter?","start":56.887}]},{"id":"c09","start":57.656,"end":60.822,"marks":{},"text":"Does it end in \"i n g\", \"e d\", or \"l y\"?","words":[{"w":"Does","start":57.656},{"w":"it","start":57.856},{"w":"end","start":58.016},{"w":"in","start":58.216},{"w":"\"i","start":58.416},{"w":"n","start":58.656},{"w":"g\",","start":58.896},{"w":"\"e","start":59.256},{"w":"d\",","start":59.576},{"w":"or","start":59.888},{"w":"\"l","start":60.199},{"w":"y\"?","start":60.51}]},{"id":"c10","start":61.222,"end":63.718,"marks":{},"text":"What are the words just before and just after it?","words":[{"w":"What","start":61.222},{"w":"are","start":61.382},{"w":"the","start":61.462},{"w":"words","start":61.622},{"w":"just","start":62.022},{"w":"before","start":62.342},{"w":"and","start":62.702},{"w":"just","start":62.902},{"w":"after","start":63.222},{"w":"it?","start":63.542}]},{"id":"c11","start":64.118,"end":70.626,"marks":{},"text":"And is it in a list of known names or places? A CRF learns from data how much to trust each clue.","words":[{"w":"And","start":64.118},{"w":"is","start":64.238},{"w":"it","start":64.438},{"w":"in","start":64.598},{"w":"a","start":64.758},{"w":"list","start":64.838},{"w":"of","start":65.078},{"w":"known","start":65.198},{"w":"names","start":65.478},{"w":"or","start":65.878},{"w":"places?","start":66.118},{"w":"A","start":66.958},{"w":"CRF","start":67.458},{"w":"learns","start":67.958},{"w":"from","start":68.398},{"w":"data","start":68.598},{"w":"how","start":69.078},{"w":"much","start":69.278},{"w":"to","start":69.518},{"w":"trust","start":69.678},{"w":"each","start":70.038},{"w":"clue.","start":70.278}]}],"title":"Clues a CRF can use","shortTitle":"Clues a CRF can use","props":{"kicker":"Clues","title":"Clues you can give a CRF","items":[{"text":"Does the word start with a capital letter?"},{"text":"Does it end in -ing, -ed or -ly?"},{"text":"What are the words just before and after?"},{"text":"Is it in a list of known names or places?"}],"numbered":false},"start":50.533,"end":70.626,"startFrame":1516,"durationInFrames":630},{"id":"vs","kind":"core","component":"Compare","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c12","start":71.533,"end":73.806,"marks":{},"text":"Let's compare it with last lesson's model.","words":[{"w":"Let's","start":71.533},{"w":"compare","start":71.893},{"w":"it","start":72.293},{"w":"with","start":72.453},{"w":"last","start":72.76},{"w":"lesson's","start":73.066},{"w":"model.","start":73.373}]},{"id":"c13","start":74.206,"end":81.551,"marks":{},"text":"An HMM is generative. Its only clues are the previous tag and the current word, and it learns by counting.","words":[{"w":"An","start":74.606},{"w":"HMM","start":75.006},{"w":"is","start":75.406},{"w":"generative.","start":75.646},{"w":"Its","start":76.526},{"w":"only","start":76.926},{"w":"clues","start":77.206},{"w":"are","start":77.646},{"w":"the","start":77.766},{"w":"previous","start":77.966},{"w":"tag","start":78.446},{"w":"and","start":78.846},{"w":"the","start":78.966},{"w":"current","start":79.086},{"w":"word,","start":79.526},{"w":"and","start":79.846},{"w":"it","start":80.086},{"w":"learns","start":80.246},{"w":"by","start":80.726},{"w":"counting.","start":80.966}]},{"id":"c14","start":81.951,"end":91.693,"marks":{},"text":"A CRF is discriminative. It can use clues from anywhere in the sentence, and it learns how much to trust each one. Same job, much more freedom.","words":[{"w":"A","start":81.951},{"w":"CRF","start":82.471},{"w":"is","start":82.991},{"w":"discriminative.","start":83.231},{"w":"It","start":84.271},{"w":"can","start":84.471},{"w":"use","start":84.671},{"w":"clues","start":84.951},{"w":"from","start":85.351},{"w":"anywhere","start":85.551},{"w":"in","start":86.031},{"w":"the","start":86.151},{"w":"sentence,","start":86.271},{"w":"and","start":86.831},{"w":"it","start":87.031},{"w":"learns","start":87.191},{"w":"how","start":87.631},{"w":"much","start":87.871},{"w":"to","start":88.151},{"w":"trust","start":88.311},{"w":"each","start":88.671},{"w":"one.","start":88.911},{"w":"Same","start":89.551},{"w":"job,","start":89.991},{"w":"much","start":90.511},{"w":"more","start":90.871},{"w":"freedom.","start":91.071}]}],"title":"HMM versus CRF","shortTitle":"HMM versus CRF","props":{"kicker":"Compare","title":"HMM versus CRF","columns":[{"title":"HMM","items":["generative","clues: previous tag + the word","learns by counting"],"tone":"neutral"},{"title":"CRF","items":["discriminative","clues: anything in the sentence","learns how much to trust each clue"],"tone":"good"}],"verdict":{"text":"Same job, much more freedom"}},"start":71.533,"end":91.693,"startFrame":2146,"durationInFrames":632},{"id":"decide","kind":"core","component":"Steps","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c15","start":92.6,"end":96.684,"marks":{},"text":"So how does a CRF choose the tags? Think of it as a points system.","words":[{"w":"So","start":92.6},{"w":"how","start":92.76},{"w":"does","start":92.96},{"w":"a","start":93.16},{"w":"CRF","start":93.54},{"w":"choose","start":93.92},{"w":"the","start":94.28},{"w":"tags?","start":94.44},{"w":"Think","start":95},{"w":"of","start":95.28},{"w":"it","start":95.4},{"w":"as","start":95.56},{"w":"a","start":95.76},{"w":"points","start":95.88},{"w":"system.","start":96.12}]},{"id":"c16","start":97.084,"end":101.677,"marks":{},"text":"Score clues: every clue adds or removes points for each possible tag.","words":[{"w":"Score","start":97.084},{"w":"clues:","start":97.524},{"w":"every","start":98.044},{"w":"clue","start":98.404},{"w":"adds","start":98.764},{"w":"or","start":99.204},{"w":"removes","start":99.404},{"w":"points","start":99.924},{"w":"for","start":100.284},{"w":"each","start":100.444},{"w":"possible","start":100.684},{"w":"tag.","start":101.244}]},{"id":"c17","start":102.077,"end":106.277,"marks":{},"text":"Score pairs: tags that fit well next to each other earn extra points.","words":[{"w":"Score","start":102.077},{"w":"pairs:","start":102.557},{"w":"tags","start":103.197},{"w":"that","start":103.677},{"w":"fit","start":103.837},{"w":"well","start":104.077},{"w":"next","start":104.277},{"w":"to","start":104.557},{"w":"each","start":104.677},{"w":"other","start":104.837},{"w":"earn","start":105.077},{"w":"extra","start":105.357},{"w":"points.","start":105.797}]},{"id":"c18","start":106.677,"end":110.623,"marks":{},"text":"Add up: that gives a total score for every possible sequence of tags.","words":[{"w":"Add","start":106.837},{"w":"up:","start":106.997},{"w":"that","start":107.237},{"w":"gives","start":107.477},{"w":"a","start":107.717},{"w":"total","start":107.837},{"w":"score","start":108.237},{"w":"for","start":108.597},{"w":"every","start":108.797},{"w":"possible","start":109.037},{"w":"sequence","start":109.557},{"w":"of","start":109.997},{"w":"tags.","start":110.117}]},{"id":"c19","start":111.023,"end":118.387,"marks":{},"text":"Pick the best: and our old friend, the Viterbi algorithm, finds the highest-scoring sequence quickly, without trying them all.","words":[{"w":"Pick","start":111.023},{"w":"the","start":111.343},{"w":"best:","start":111.503},{"w":"and","start":111.943},{"w":"our","start":112.143},{"w":"old","start":112.383},{"w":"friend,","start":112.663},{"w":"the","start":113.023},{"w":"Viterbi","start":113.183},{"w":"algorithm,","start":113.743},{"w":"finds","start":114.543},{"w":"the","start":115.023},{"w":"highest-scoring","start":115.543},{"w":"sequence","start":116.063},{"w":"quickly,","start":116.583},{"w":"without","start":117.103},{"w":"trying","start":117.463},{"w":"them","start":117.903},{"w":"all.","start":118.103}]}],"title":"How a CRF decides","shortTitle":"How a CRF decides","props":{"kicker":"Inside a CRF","title":"How a CRF picks the tags","steps":[{"label":"Score clues","detail":"each clue adds or removes points"},{"label":"Score pairs","detail":"points for tags that fit together"},{"label":"Add up","detail":"a total for every tag sequence"},{"label":"Pick the best","detail":"Viterbi finds the top score fast"}]},"start":92.6,"end":118.387,"startFrame":2778,"durationInFrames":801},{"id":"ner","kind":"core","component":"Table","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c20","start":119.3,"end":128.31,"marks":{},"text":"CRFs were long a top choice for named entity recognition: finding the names of people, places and dates in text. Here's a sentence.","words":[{"w":"CRFs","start":119.88},{"w":"were","start":120.46},{"w":"long","start":120.62},{"w":"a","start":120.82},{"w":"top","start":120.94},{"w":"choice","start":121.18},{"w":"for","start":121.54},{"w":"named","start":121.7},{"w":"entity","start":122.02},{"w":"recognition:","start":122.46},{"w":"finding","start":123.42},{"w":"the","start":123.9},{"w":"names","start":124.06},{"w":"of","start":124.38},{"w":"people,","start":124.58},{"w":"places","start":125.06},{"w":"and","start":125.58},{"w":"dates","start":125.78},{"w":"in","start":126.18},{"w":"text.","start":126.38},{"w":"Here's","start":126.98},{"w":"a","start":127.5},{"w":"sentence.","start":127.62}]},{"id":"c21","start":128.71,"end":132.295,"marks":{},"text":"Rahul gets PERSON: a capital letter, and a known first name.","words":[{"w":"Rahul","start":129.003},{"w":"gets","start":129.297},{"w":"PERSON:","start":129.59},{"w":"a","start":130.03},{"w":"capital","start":130.23},{"w":"letter,","start":130.75},{"w":"and","start":131.07},{"w":"a","start":131.19},{"w":"known","start":131.31},{"w":"first","start":131.63},{"w":"name.","start":131.95}]},{"id":"c22","start":132.695,"end":135.457,"marks":{},"text":"Flew gets O, meaning it isn't part of any name.","words":[{"w":"Flew","start":132.922},{"w":"gets","start":133.148},{"w":"O,","start":133.375},{"w":"meaning","start":133.655},{"w":"it","start":134.095},{"w":"isn't","start":134.255},{"w":"part","start":134.575},{"w":"of","start":134.775},{"w":"any","start":134.895},{"w":"name.","start":135.175}]},{"id":"c23","start":135.857,"end":137.145,"marks":{},"text":"To gets O as well.","words":[{"w":"To","start":135.857},{"w":"gets","start":136.017},{"w":"O","start":136.337},{"w":"as","start":136.577},{"w":"well.","start":136.817}]},{"id":"c24","start":137.545,"end":140.782,"marks":{},"text":"Paris gets PLACE: a capital letter, right after \"to\".","words":[{"w":"Paris","start":137.545},{"w":"gets","start":137.945},{"w":"PLACE:","start":138.345},{"w":"a","start":138.665},{"w":"capital","start":138.865},{"w":"letter,","start":139.385},{"w":"right","start":139.705},{"w":"after","start":140.025},{"w":"\"to\".","start":140.404}]},{"id":"c25","start":141.182,"end":142.679,"marks":{},"text":"On is just another O.","words":[{"w":"On","start":141.182},{"w":"is","start":141.422},{"w":"just","start":141.662},{"w":"another","start":141.942},{"w":"O.","start":142.342}]},{"id":"c26","start":143.079,"end":145.813,"marks":{},"text":"And Monday gets DATE, because it's a day of the week.","words":[{"w":"And","start":143.079},{"w":"Monday","start":143.239},{"w":"gets","start":143.679},{"w":"DATE,","start":143.999},{"w":"because","start":144.399},{"w":"it's","start":144.639},{"w":"a","start":144.879},{"w":"day","start":144.999},{"w":"of","start":145.199},{"w":"the","start":145.319},{"w":"week.","start":145.479}]}],"title":"Finding names","shortTitle":"How AI spots names, places and dates","props":{"kicker":"Named entity recognition","title":"“Rahul flew to Paris on Monday”","columns":["Word","Tag","Strong clue"],"rows":[["Rahul","PERSON","capital letter, a known first name"],["flew","O","lowercase verb"],["to","O","common little word"],["Paris","PLACE","capital, after “to”"],["on","O","common little word"],["Monday","DATE","a day of the week"]],"highlight":[{"row":0,"col":1},{"row":3,"col":1},{"row":5,"col":1}]},"start":119.3,"end":145.813,"startFrame":3579,"durationInFrames":823},{"id":"uses","kind":"core","component":"Bullets","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c27","start":146.733,"end":148.378,"marks":{},"text":"Where are CRFs used?","words":[{"w":"Where","start":146.733},{"w":"are","start":147.144},{"w":"CRFs","start":147.556},{"w":"used?","start":147.967}]},{"id":"c28","start":148.778,"end":152.654,"marks":{},"text":"Finding names of people, places, organisations and dates.","words":[{"w":"Finding","start":148.778},{"w":"names","start":149.258},{"w":"of","start":149.578},{"w":"people,","start":149.778},{"w":"places,","start":150.258},{"w":"organisations","start":150.978},{"w":"and","start":151.978},{"w":"dates.","start":152.178}]},{"id":"c29","start":153.054,"end":155.04,"marks":{},"text":"Part-of-speech tagging and chunking.","words":[{"w":"Part-of-speech","start":153.454},{"w":"tagging","start":153.854},{"w":"and","start":154.249},{"w":"chunking.","start":154.645}]},{"id":"c30","start":155.44,"end":163.879,"marks":{},"text":"And even today, a CRF layer is often placed on top of a neural network, to make sure the tags it outputs fit together sensibly.","words":[{"w":"And","start":155.44},{"w":"even","start":155.64},{"w":"today,","start":156.14},{"w":"a","start":156.64},{"w":"CRF","start":157.12},{"w":"layer","start":157.6},{"w":"is","start":158},{"w":"often","start":158.16},{"w":"placed","start":158.56},{"w":"on","start":158.84},{"w":"top","start":159.04},{"w":"of","start":159.32},{"w":"a","start":159.48},{"w":"neural","start":159.56},{"w":"network,","start":159.92},{"w":"to","start":160.64},{"w":"make","start":160.8},{"w":"sure","start":161.04},{"w":"the","start":161.28},{"w":"tags","start":161.52},{"w":"it","start":161.76},{"w":"outputs","start":162},{"w":"fit","start":162.56},{"w":"together","start":162.84},{"w":"sensibly.","start":163.24}]}],"title":"Where CRFs are used","shortTitle":"Where CRFs are used","props":{"kicker":"In practice","title":"Where you'll find CRFs","items":[{"text":"Finding names of people, places and dates"},{"text":"Part-of-speech tagging and chunking"},{"text":"On top of neural networks, to keep tags consistent"}],"numbered":false},"start":146.733,"end":163.879,"startFrame":4402,"durationInFrames":542},{"id":"quiz","kind":"quiz","component":"Quiz","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c31","start":164.8,"end":174.937,"marks":{},"text":"Quick quiz. Which clue can a CRF use easily, but a basic HMM can't: the previous tag, whether the word starts with a capital letter, or the current word?","words":[{"w":"Quick","start":165.067},{"w":"quiz.","start":165.333},{"w":"Which","start":165.6},{"w":"clue","start":165.88},{"w":"can","start":166.24},{"w":"a","start":166.56},{"w":"CRF","start":166.88},{"w":"use","start":167.2},{"w":"easily,","start":167.56},{"w":"but","start":168.12},{"w":"a","start":168.32},{"w":"basic","start":168.48},{"w":"HMM","start":169.1},{"w":"can't:","start":169.72},{"w":"the","start":170.24},{"w":"previous","start":170.56},{"w":"tag,","start":171.12},{"w":"whether","start":171.56},{"w":"the","start":171.92},{"w":"word","start":172.08},{"w":"starts","start":172.36},{"w":"with","start":172.76},{"w":"a","start":172.88},{"w":"capital","start":173},{"w":"letter,","start":173.48},{"w":"or","start":173.84},{"w":"the","start":174},{"w":"current","start":174.2},{"w":"word?","start":174.64}]},{"id":"c32","start":175.337,"end":176.857,"marks":{},"text":"Pause the video and choose.","words":[{"w":"Pause","start":175.337},{"w":"the","start":175.617},{"w":"video","start":175.877},{"w":"and","start":176.137},{"w":"choose.","start":176.337}]},{"id":"c33","start":180.257,"end":188.963,"marks":{},"text":"It's the capital letter. A basic HMM only uses the previous tag and the word itself. A CRF can add any clue you like.","words":[{"w":"It's","start":180.257},{"w":"the","start":180.457},{"w":"capital","start":180.617},{"w":"letter.","start":181.177},{"w":"A","start":181.657},{"w":"basic","start":181.857},{"w":"HMM","start":182.517},{"w":"only","start":183.177},{"w":"uses","start":183.497},{"w":"the","start":183.857},{"w":"previous","start":184.017},{"w":"tag","start":184.537},{"w":"and","start":184.937},{"w":"the","start":185.137},{"w":"word","start":185.297},{"w":"itself.","start":185.617},{"w":"A","start":186.497},{"w":"CRF","start":187.017},{"w":"can","start":187.537},{"w":"add","start":187.697},{"w":"any","start":187.937},{"w":"clue","start":188.177},{"w":"you","start":188.497},{"w":"like.","start":188.697}]}],"title":"Quick quiz","shortTitle":"Quick quiz: HMM or CRF?","props":{"kicker":"Pause and predict","question":"Which clue can a CRF use easily, but a basic HMM can't?","options":["The previous tag","Whether the word starts with a capital letter","The current word"],"answer":1,"explain":"An HMM only uses the previous tag and the word itself; a CRF can add any clue, like capitals."},"start":164.8,"end":188.963,"startFrame":4944,"durationInFrames":752},{"id":"recap","kind":"recap","component":"Recap","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c34","start":189.867,"end":193.971,"marks":{},"text":"Let's recap. A CRF scores a whole sequence of tags at once.","words":[{"w":"Let's","start":189.867},{"w":"recap.","start":190.227},{"w":"A","start":190.907},{"w":"CRF","start":191.347},{"w":"scores","start":191.787},{"w":"a","start":192.227},{"w":"whole","start":192.347},{"w":"sequence","start":192.547},{"w":"of","start":192.947},{"w":"tags","start":193.067},{"w":"at","start":193.427},{"w":"once.","start":193.627}]},{"id":"c35","start":194.371,"end":199.52,"marks":{},"text":"It can use any clues you give it: capital letters, word endings, neighbouring words, and more.","words":[{"w":"It","start":194.371},{"w":"can","start":194.451},{"w":"use","start":194.611},{"w":"any","start":194.811},{"w":"clues","start":195.011},{"w":"you","start":195.331},{"w":"give","start":195.571},{"w":"it:","start":195.771},{"w":"capital","start":196.091},{"w":"letters,","start":196.691},{"w":"word","start":197.251},{"w":"endings,","start":197.491},{"w":"neighbouring","start":198.051},{"w":"words,","start":198.651},{"w":"and","start":199.011},{"w":"more.","start":199.211}]},{"id":"c36","start":199.92,"end":203.423,"marks":{},"text":"It's discriminative, so it learns how much to trust each clue.","words":[{"w":"It's","start":199.92},{"w":"discriminative,","start":200.16},{"w":"so","start":201.08},{"w":"it","start":201.28},{"w":"learns","start":201.44},{"w":"how","start":201.84},{"w":"much","start":202.08},{"w":"to","start":202.28},{"w":"trust","start":202.44},{"w":"each","start":202.8},{"w":"clue.","start":203.04}]},{"id":"c37","start":203.823,"end":207.442,"marks":{},"text":"And the Viterbi algorithm finds the best-scoring tags quickly.","words":[{"w":"And","start":203.823},{"w":"the","start":203.903},{"w":"Viterbi","start":204.023},{"w":"algorithm","start":204.543},{"w":"finds","start":205.303},{"w":"the","start":205.703},{"w":"best-scoring","start":206.138},{"w":"tags","start":206.573},{"w":"quickly.","start":207.007}]},{"id":"c38","start":207.842,"end":212.916,"marks":{},"text":"Next lesson: Constituency Parsing. How does a computer see the structure of a sentence?","words":[{"w":"Next","start":208.149},{"w":"lesson:","start":208.455},{"w":"Constituency","start":208.762},{"w":"Parsing.","start":209.722},{"w":"How","start":210.322},{"w":"does","start":210.602},{"w":"a","start":210.842},{"w":"computer","start":210.962},{"w":"see","start":211.402},{"w":"the","start":211.562},{"w":"structure","start":211.682},{"w":"of","start":212.082},{"w":"a","start":212.242},{"w":"sentence?","start":212.322}]}],"title":"Recap and next lesson","shortTitle":"Recap and next lesson","props":{"title":"Recap","points":["A CRF scores the whole tag sequence at once","It can use any clues: capitals, endings, neighbours","It's discriminative: it learns how much to trust each clue","Viterbi finds the best-scoring tags"],"next":{"title":"Constituency Parsing","question":"How does a computer see the structure of a sentence?"}},"start":189.867,"end":212.916,"startFr